  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "num": "01",
      "en": "When it comes to wildlife protection, all {species}—the good, the bad, and the ugly—should be treated equally. Pandas, dolphins, and other cute wildlife are important, but we must pay attention to less cute animals, too.",
      "cn": "说到野生动植物保护，所有物种——无论好的、坏的，还是丑的——都应受到平等对待。熊猫、海豚以及其他可爱的野生动物固然重要，但我们也必须关注那些不那么可爱的动物。"
    },
    {
      "num": "02",
      "en": "The world needs all kinds—without variety, our planet cannot survive. So if you want the future to be beautiful, you have to give ugly a chance.",
      "cn": "世界需要各种各样的物种——没有多样性，我们的地球就无法存续。所以，如果你想让未来变得美好，就必须给\"丑\"一个机会。"
    }
  ],
